{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>ויסעו.</b> The samekh ought to take a dagesh with the assimilation of the nun, as in ויגשו (Genesis 19:9) and ויתנו (ibid. 35:4). Perhaps it appears thus to lighten the pronunciation." "<b>מרעמסס</b> with patach under the resh and sheva under the ayin. It is the name of a district, not a city." "<b>סכתה.</b> [Meaning] to Sukkot." "The men are mentioned, and there is no need to mention the women, for they are like them, or more." "<b>לבד מטף.</b> Who are under twenty years."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:53.335529714Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}